  "summary": "Malicious code in @or-sdk/markdowner (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from the oven-sh/bun GitHub releases and uses it to execute a 727KB obfuscated script (math_init.js) bundled in the package. The script is obfuscated with a large encoded string array and a custom decoder, and contains eval/Function/child_process usage. The package also declares a dependency on @or-sdk/base. The obfuscated payload's network behavior is not visible statically.",
